DTSTAMP:20260914T034332Z
DTSTART:20260914T114317Z
DTEND:20260914T130111Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:15:47 and reappears at 18:28:58 IST\, se
 en from Panaji.\nThe Moon is 42° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +19°.\nT
 imes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon'
 s edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Panaji
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Panaji
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:The Moon occults Venus
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
